{"title":"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Jim wrote the sequence of symbols a total of 50 times. How many more heart symbols than spade symbols did he write?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(description: heart, spade, spade, heart, diamond, heart, heart, heart, diamond)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/023791d99cf4aab50c268183c622b19305f566f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 50 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 150 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 200 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 250 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 275$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> heart symbols and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> spade symbols in the sequence. \n</p><p>Thus, every time he wrote the sequence, he wrote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/7/b074830f05d7d2ed47f4e110e1d02388e24c4600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> more heart symbols than spade symbols.\n</p><p>Because he wrote the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times, this means that he wrote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/5/cd5bd7478f92a8399a26a83c76944ebfd702297a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 50 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 150}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"149\" height=\"30\" /> more hearts than spades.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2015 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/inde